,Calc all Costs for Cubby Horizontals
Set, #ShelfWidth = [#W]
Do, (#horizontalpricechoice="Shelf"):1
{
Load, C-Shelf Cost.Pcb
set, #tempshelfcount=#NumH
load, countshelves.pcb
set, #displaythickness={#sideTH}
